Package: ompbn
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Network Learning Using the OMP Algorithm
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-09-21
Authors@R: c(person("Michail", "Tsagris", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mtsagris@uoc.gr"))
Author: Michail Tsagris [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Michail Tsagris <mtsagris@uoc.gr>
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: bnlearn, pchc, Rfast, stats
Description: Bayesian network learning using the orthogonal matching pursuit to perform variable selection and then application of the Hill-Climbing greedy search or the TABU search to orient the edges. Some relevant papers are  Tsagris M. (2021), <doi:10.1007/s10614-020-10065-7>, Tsagris M. (2022) <doi:10.3390/math10152604>, Tsagris et al. (2022) <doi:10.1109/TCBB.2020.3029952>, Tsamardinos I., Brown E.L. and Aliferis F.C. (2006) <doi:10.1007/s10994-006-6889-7>, Mallat S. G. and Zhang Z. (1993) <doi:10.1109/78.258082>.
